#: main_26.cpp:35
msgid "Engine resign options"
msgstr "Zaɓuɓɓukan murabus daga injin"

#: main_26.cpp:37
msgid "Show the engine resign options dialog box"
msgstr "Nuna akwatin tattaunawa na zaɓuɓɓukan murabus na injin"

#: main_26.cpp:39
msgid "There cannot be more than 100 engines in an engine tournament."
msgstr "Ba za a iya samun injuna sama da 100 a gasar injin ba."

#: main_26.cpp:41
msgid "Engine Resignation Options"
msgstr "Zaɓuɓɓukan Murabus na Injin"

#: main_26.cpp:43
msgid "An option to dock the Free Internet Chess Server (FICS) window (version 4.4)"
msgstr "Zaɓin da za a iya amfani da shi don buɗe taga Free Internet Chess Server (FICS) (sigar 4.4)"

#: main_26.cpp:45
msgid "Automatic engine resignation in a lost position (version 4.41)"
msgstr "Murkushewar injin ta atomatik a cikin yanayin da ya ɓace (sigar 4.41)"

#: main_26.cpp:47
msgid "Nimzo_3d_ml (version 4.41) multi-lingual,"
msgstr "Nimzo_3d_ml (sigar 4.41) mai harsuna da yawa,"

#: main_26.cpp:49
msgid "Features added to Nimzo_3d - version 4.41"
msgstr "An ƙara fasaloli zuwa Nimzo_3d - sigar 4.41"

#: main_26.cpp:51
msgid "The engine evaluates its position as lost"
msgstr "Injin yana kimanta matsayinsa a matsayin wanda ya ɓace"

#: main_26.cpp:52
msgid "and offers to resign."
msgstr "kuma yana tayin yin murabus."

#: main_26.cpp:53
msgid "Do you accept the resignation?"
msgstr "Shin ka yarda da murabus ɗin?"

#: main_26.cpp:54
msgid "Engine Resignation message"
msgstr "Saƙon Murabus daga Injin"

#: main_26.cpp:55
msgid "Do not offer to resign again this game"
msgstr "Kada ka sake bayar da shawarar yin murabus a wannan wasan"

#: main_26.cpp:147
msgid "Enable engine auto-resign"
msgstr "Kunna injin ta atomatik"

#: main_26.cpp:159
msgid "Resignation threshold (Pawns: -1.0 to -50.0)"
msgstr "Matsakaicin izinin yin murabus (Pawns: -1.0 zuwa -50.0)"

#: main_26.cpp:173
msgid "Minimum search depth (Plies: 1 - 30)"
msgstr "Mafi ƙarancin zurfin bincike (Plies: 1 - 30)"

#: main_26.cpp:187
msgid "Consecutive turns below threshold (1 - 10)"
msgstr "Juyawa a jere a ƙasa da iyakar (1 - 10)"

#: main_26.cpp:201
msgid "Game moves played before first check (1 - 50)"
msgstr "An yi wasannin kafin a fara duba su (1 - 50)"

#: main_26.cpp:215
msgid "Moves to wait if resignation rejected (1 - 50)"
msgstr "Za a jira idan aka ƙi amincewa da murabus (1 - 50)"

#: main_26.cpp:229
msgid "Include forced checkmates"
msgstr "A hada da abokan wasan check na tilas"

#: main_26.cpp:241
msgid "Enable shootout resignation rules"
msgstr "Kunna ƙa'idodin murabus daga bugun fenariti"

#: main_26.cpp:253
msgid "Player versus engine games"
msgstr "Wasannin 'yan wasa da injin"

#: main_26.cpp:262
msgid "Ask before resigning"
msgstr "Tambaya kafin yin murabus"

#: main_26.cpp:363
msgid "Enables automatic engine resignation."
msgstr "Yana ba da damar cire injin ta atomatik."

#: main_26.cpp:364
msgid "Defines the numeric pawn deficit required to offer resignation."
msgstr "Yana bayyana gibin adadi na pawn da ake buƙata don bayar da murabus."

#: main_26.cpp:365
msgid "Minimum search depth the engine must attain before resignation is offered."
msgstr "Mafi ƙarancin zurfin bincike da injin ɗin dole ne ya kai kafin a bayar da izinin yin murabus."

#: main_26.cpp:366
msgid "Number of consecutive moves worse than threshold"
msgstr "Adadin motsi a jere ya fi muni fiye da iyaka"

#: main_26.cpp:366
msgid "before resignation is offered."
msgstr "kafin a yi murabus."

#: main_26.cpp:367
msgid "Number of moves played in a game before resignation is offered."
msgstr "An bayar da adadin motsin da aka yi a wasa kafin a yi murabus."

#: main_26.cpp:368
msgid "Number of moves after a refusal before resignation can be offered again."
msgstr "Ana iya sake bayar da adadin motsi bayan kin amincewa kafin murabus."

#: main_26.cpp:369
msgid "Check to offer resignation when there is a forced checkmate."
msgstr "Duba don bayar da takardar murabus idan akwai abokin aikin da aka tilasta masa."

#: main_26.cpp:370
msgid "Check for engine to resign in shootout mode, if justified."
msgstr "Duba injin ɗin don ya yi aiki a yanayin bugun ƙwallo, idan ya dace."

#: main_26.cpp:371
msgid "Check to prompt user for consent when the engine offers to resign."
msgstr "Duba don neman izini ga mai amfani lokacin da injin ɗin ya yi tayin yin murabus."

#: main_26.cpp:405
msgid "Engine Auto-Resignation allows weakened or completely losing engines"
msgstr "Murabus ta atomatik na injin yana ba da damar raguwa ko rasa injin gaba ɗaya"

#: main_26.cpp:407
msgid "to offer standard resignation, rather than forcing you to spend time and effort"
msgstr "don yin murabus na yau da kullun, maimakon tilasta maka ka ɓatar da lokaci da ƙoƙari"

#: main_26.cpp:409
msgid "playing out a completely lost position to the final move."
msgstr "wasa a matsayin wanda aka rasa gaba ɗaya zuwa ga matakin ƙarshe."

#: main_26.cpp:412
msgid "Options configuration description -"
msgstr "Bayanin saitin zaɓuɓɓuka -"

#: main_26.cpp:414
msgid "Enable engine auto-resign  -  Check to enable the chess engine to offer to resign"
msgstr "Kunna injin ta atomatik - Duba don kunna injin chess don bayar da tayin yin murabus"

#: main_26.cpp:419
msgid "Resignation threshold  -  Set the numeric evaluation threshold in pawns."
msgstr "Maƙasudin Ritaya - Saita maƙasudin kimanta lambobi a cikin pawns."

#: main_26.cpp:421
msgid "that the position has to be worse than, for the engine to offer resignation."
msgstr "cewa dole ne matsayin ya fi muni fiye da, don injin ya bayar da murabus."

#: main_26.cpp:423
msgid "Default is -15.0 pawns.  This could be set as low as -3.0 for engine only games."
msgstr "Tsarin tsoho shine pawns -15.0. Ana iya saita wannan ƙasa zuwa -3.0 don wasannin injin kawai."

#: main_26.cpp:426
msgid "Minimum search depth  -  Input the depth that the engine must reach before"
msgstr "Mafi ƙarancin zurfin bincike - Shigar da zurfin da injin dole ne ya isa kafin"

#: main_26.cpp:428
msgid "the engine offers to resign.  This prevents early calculation spikes or volatile"
msgstr "Injin yana bayar da shawarar yin murabus. Wannan yana hana ƙaruwar lissafi da wuri ko kuma canzawa"

#: main_26.cpp:430
msgid "tactical sacrifices from causing panic resignations."
msgstr "sadaukarwa ta dabara daga haifar da firgici."

#: main_26.cpp:433
msgid "Consecutive turns below threshold  -  Input the number of moves worse than"
msgstr "Juyawa a jere ƙasa da iyaka - Shigar da adadin motsi mafi muni fiye da"

#: main_26.cpp:435
msgid "the threshold that have to pass before the engine offers to resign."
msgstr "matakin da dole ne ya wuce kafin injin ya bayar da tayin yin murabus."

#: main_26.cpp:437
msgid "This is an additional check, essential for heavily throttled engines"
msgstr "Wannan ƙarin dubawa ne, wanda yake da mahimmanci ga injunan da ke fama da matsanancin matsin lamba"

#: main_26.cpp:439
msgid "that never reach deeper search depths."
msgstr "wanda ba ya taɓa kaiwa zurfin bincike mai zurfi."

#: main_26.cpp:442
msgid "Minimum game move limit  -  Input the number of moves that have to be played"
msgstr "Mafi ƙarancin iyaka ga motsa wasa - Shigar da adadin motsi da za a yi"

#: main_26.cpp:444
msgid "in a game before resignation is offered."
msgstr "a wasa kafin a yi tayin yin murabus."

#: main_26.cpp:447
msgid "Moves to wait if refusal encountered  -  Input the number of full moves that the engine"
msgstr "Yana jira idan aka sami ƙin amincewa - Shigar da adadin cikakken motsi da injin ɗin ya yi"

#: main_26.cpp:449
msgid "has to wait after the user refuses to accept a resignation offer, before the engine"
msgstr "dole ne ya jira bayan mai amfani ya ƙi karɓar tayin murabus, kafin injin ya fara aiki"

#: main_26.cpp:451
msgid "offers to resign again."
msgstr "yana tayin sake yin murabus."

#: main_26.cpp:454
msgid "Include forced checkmates  -  Check to include forced mates, foreseen by the engine,"
msgstr "Haɗa da abokan wasan check da aka tilasta musu - Duba don haɗa da abokan wasan da aka tilasta musu, waɗanda injin ya hango,"

#: main_26.cpp:456
msgid "in the resignation offer criteria."
msgstr "a cikin sharuɗɗan tayin murabus."

#: main_26.cpp:458
msgid "You may want to leave this off, if you want to work out a checkmate for yourself."
msgstr "Kuna iya son barin wannan, idan kuna son yin aiki da abokin ciniki don kanku."

#: main_26.cpp:461
msgid "Resign in engine shootout  -  Check for the engine to resign in shootout mode,"
msgstr "Yi murabus a harbin injin - Duba injin don ya yi murabus a yanayin harbi,"

#: main_26.cpp:463
msgid "if the other resignation criteria have been fulfilled."
msgstr "idan an cika sauran sharuɗɗan murabus."

#: main_26.cpp:464
msgid "Ask before resigning  -  Check if you want the engine to get consent from the user"
msgstr "Tambayi kafin yin murabus - Duba idan kana son injin ya sami izini daga mai amfani"

#: main_26.cpp:466
msgid "before it resigns in a human versus engine game."
msgstr "kafin ta yi murabus a wasan ɗan adam da injin."

#: main_26.cpp:468
msgid "In engine versus engine games, the engine will silently resign,"
msgstr "A wasannin injin da injin, injin zai yi murabus a hankali,"

#: main_26.cpp:470
msgid "without asking for permission."
msgstr "ba tare da neman izini ba."

#: main_26.cpp:473
msgid "Engine Resignation Documentation"
msgstr "Takardun Riƙe Injin"
